{"id":17059,"name":"Washington County","slug":"washington-county","state":"Maryland","code":"MD","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-lien/tax-lien-states/maryland-tax-liens-earn-solid-as-a-beginner/washington-county/","lastUpdated":"2026-07-13T12:29:55","facts":{"taxSaleType":"Tax Lien Certificates","typicalSaleDate":"First Tuesday in June","redemptionPeriod":"6 months to 2 years","interestRate":"6% per annum","bidProcedure":"Premium bidding, the highest bid wins","deposit":"$100 non-refundable registration fee","extra":[{"label":"Auction Site","value":"Rear of Washington County Office Building , 35 West Washington Street, Hagerstown, MD"},{"label":"County Website","value":"Washington County"},{"label":"Tax Lien Sale Info","value":"Tax Sale Information"}]},"bodyHtml":"\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Washington County, Maryland Tax Lien Sales: A Simple Guide</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed aligncenter is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"erEk6OSyXimRsbxIn2fMAopu\"><iframe title=\"This Is Your Clear Path To Foreclosure - Washington County - Maryland Tax Lien Investing\" width=\"1170\" height=\"658\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/uJLQ0KVlxXE?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<p>Investing in tax lien certificates in Washington County, Maryland, can offer great returns compared to traditional investments. With a low entry cost, it&#8217;s an attractive option for savvy investors. Let&#8217;s dive into how it works and the key details you need to know.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Understanding Tax Lien Certificates</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>A tax lien certificate is a claim against a property for unpaid taxes. When you buy a tax lien, you&#8217;re paying the property owner&#8217;s taxes. In return, you earn interest until the owner repays the debt. If the owner doesn’t pay, you can foreclose on the property.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Steps to Start Tax Lien Investing</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Research and Understand Local Laws</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Familiarize yourself with Maryland’s legal framework for tax lien sales.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Visit the Local Treasurer&#8217;s Website</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.washco-md.net/treasurers-office/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Washington County Treasurer’s Office</mark></a></p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Check the Auction Site</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Auctions are held at the <a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/i1ztmYiBS1FbK1xL9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Washington County Office Building</mark></a>, 35 West Washington Street, Hagerstown, MD.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Read the Details About Tax Liens</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Learn about the sale schedule and parcel inquiry.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Contact the County Office</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Phone: 240-313-2110</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Email: <a href=\"mailto:treasurer3@washco-md.net\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">treasurer3@washco-md.net</mark></a></p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Important Details</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Washington-County-Courthouse-Hagerstown-Maryland.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Washington-County-Courthouse-Hagerstown-Maryland-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Washington-County-Courthouse-Hagerstown-Maryland-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Washington-County-Courthouse-Hagerstown-Maryland-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Washington-County-Courthouse-Hagerstown-Maryland-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Washington-County-Courthouse-Hagerstown-Maryland-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Washington-County-Courthouse-Hagerstown-Maryland.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Washington-County-Courthouse-Hagerstown-Maryland.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Washington-County-Courthouse-Hagerstown-Maryland-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Washington-County-Courthouse-Hagerstown-Maryland-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Washington-County-Courthouse-Hagerstown-Maryland-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Washington-County-Courthouse-Hagerstown-Maryland-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Washington-County-Courthouse-Hagerstown-Maryland-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-17085 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Washington County Courthouse, Hagerstown, Maryland\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-pro-tips\">Pro Tips</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Pre-register Early:</strong> Complete your registration by the Friday before the sale.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Bid Smart:</strong> Research properties beforehand to avoid overbidding.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Track Deadlines:</strong> Ensure timely payments to avoid forfeiture of your winning bid.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Attractions and Economic Highlights</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Washington County is a significant industrial and transportation hub in the Mid-Atlantic region. With excellent rail services and a regional airport, it&#8217;s well-connected. Major employers include Amazon, FedEx, and Volvo Group. Key attractions include the Antietam National Battlefield and Chesapeake &amp; Ohio Canal National Historical Park.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">FAQs</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: What happens if the property owner redeems the lien?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: You receive the amount you paid plus the 6% interest.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: When can I start foreclosure?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: You can initiate foreclosure six months after the sale, within a two-year limit.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: What if I miss the sale?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: Unsold properties may be available at a later date.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Useful Links</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.washco-md.net/treasurers-office/tax-sale-information/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Tax Sale Information</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.washco-md.net/treasurers-office/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Washington County Treasurer’s Office</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.washco-md.net/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Washington County</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-lien/tax-lien-states/maryland-tax-liens-earn-solid-as-a-beginner/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Earn Solid 6-20% ROI In Maryland Tax Liens!</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-lien/tax-lien-investing-overview/understanding-tax-lien-certificates/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Learn How Does Tax Lien Investing Work</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://youtu.be/eNKIUQC6io0?si=b31MOzg-xCeQzAUA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Want to get started